&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AccuWeather is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Chief of Staff / Executive Operations Director for Founder &amp;amp; Executive Chair Dr. Joel N. Myers.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;This is an intense, in-person, demanding, proactive, and transformational executive role — not a conventional administrative or support position — built to multiply the impact of an active Founder &amp;amp; Executive Chair of a well-known high technology and media company. The role reports solely to Dr. Myers and is accountable to him, while operating with full respect for and support of the CEO’s authority to run the company. You will be working directly with one of the top entrepreneurs in American history, converting his strategic, commercial, marketing, product, and customer insight into focused initiatives and measurable results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;manage complex, high-volume Executive calendar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;manage Executive correspondence and ensure Executive’s time aligns with priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;assist with meeting preparation including briefings, meeting materials, agenda creation, daily reports, and follow-up actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;proactively keep our CRM current. capture and maintain up-to-date data on key contacts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;coordinate domestic and international travel and other calendar activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;lead and develop the executive support team, raising standards, ownership, and continuity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;own day-to-day administrative and office operations and project support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;assist with strategic projects, initiatives and deliverables on behalf of the Executive Chair, ensuring they are executed effectively and according to schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;capture, organize, and convert the Executive Chair’s strategic, commercial, marketing, product, and customer insights into prioritized initiatives with clear ownership and follow-through&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;help connect sales, marketing, product, technology, and customer strategy efforts to strengthen commercialization, pricing, and revenue growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;draft and edit communications on behalf of the Executive Chair, including emails, and presentations, speeches and transcriptions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;coordinate with home and personal staff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;maintain the highest level of confidentiality and discretion in handling sensitive information and matters building trust with Executive Chair, Executive leadership, Board members and key stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;use AI &amp;amp; technology to gain leverage, improve office operations and efficiency and build and lead an AI-enabled operating system for meeting preparation, knowledge capture, project tracking, correspondence, decisions, and follow-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years’ experience and success as a Chief of Staff, Executive Operations leader, or senior general-management role in a founder-led, growth-oriented, or commercially demanding environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;extremely organized and with exceptional time management and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;you’re professional and operate with a high degree of discretion and integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;excellent communication skills and ability to build relationships internationally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;comfortable with AI/technology and can quickly adopt tools like Claude, Chat GPT, google suite, slack, zapier, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;comfortable with ambiguity and is curious about tech and eager to learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;people you have worked with put you in the top 1% of people they have worked with&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;executive presence and sound judgment, with the confidence to engage directly with a highly experienced founder&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;commercial fluency and the ability to connect strategy, sales, marketing, product, and technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;track record of leading or upgrading teams and converting ideas into measurable outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;genuinely interested in building a long-term relationship with the Founder, not using the role as a short-term step&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;comfortable being in the office each day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Shouldn’t Apply If&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;you need a highly predictable and comfortable work schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;want to work from home&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;want only a 9-5 job&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive healthcare and dental benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) retirement plan with 50% company match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual performance bonus tied to clearly defined outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meaningful relocation assistance and, where appropriate, temporary housing or transition support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Potential long-term retention or incentive arrangement for an exceptional candidate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative work environment and opportunity to work with a high-impact team and Mission driven company that has saved over 12,000 lives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AccuWeather&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;AccuWeather, recognized and documented as the most accurate and most used source of weather forecasts and warnings in the world, has saved over 12,000 lives, prevented injury to over 100,000 people, and saved companies tens of billions of dollars through better planning and decision-making. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Billions of people around the world rely on AccuWeather’s proven Superior Accuracy™ across our consumer digital platforms.&amp;nbsp;AccuWeather.com&amp;nbsp;is the #1 weather destination and one of the top 100 most-visited websites in the world, and our award-winning AccuWeather app delivers detailed real-time forecasts to tens of millions of smartphones.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;AccuWeather forecasts also appear on digital signage, in 700 newspapers, are heard on over 400 radio stations, and viewed on 100 television stations. The AccuWeather Network and AccuWeather NOW® reach an audience of over 250 million on cable and streaming platforms including DirecTV, Charter Communications - Spectrum, Verizon, Philo, Frndly TV, Comcast’s Xfinity X1 and Xfinity Stream, Roku, Xumo, Rockbot, LG, and Amazon Freevee.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;AccuWeather For Business serves more than half of the Fortune 500 companies and thousands of other businesses and government agencies globally.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dr. Joel Myers, Founder and Executive Chairman, established AccuWeather in 1962 and is considered the “father of modern commercial meteorology.” Myers, a leading creative thinker and visionary, has been called “the most accurate man in weather” by The New York Times and has been recognized as one of the top entrepreneurs in American history by Entrepreneur’s Encyclopedia of Entrepreneurs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commitment to Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AccuWeather is proud to be an Equal Opportunity/Affirmative Action Employer. We are committed to equal employment opportunity to all applicants and existing employees and we evaluate qualified applicants without regard to race, creed, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy and gender identity/expression), sexual orientation, age, ancestry, physical or mental disability, marital status, political affiliation, religion, citizenship status, genetic information, veteran status, or any other basis protected under applicable federal, state, or local law.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;AccuWeather is committed to working with and providing reasonable accommodations to individuals with disabilities. If you need a reasonable accommodation because of a disability for any part of the employment process, please send an e-mail to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:human.resources@accuweather.com&quot;&gt;human.resources@accuweather.com&lt;/a&gt; and let us know the nature of your request and your contact information. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;AccuWeather is searching for a Chief Operating Officer to join its Leadership team. Reporting to the Chief Executive Officer, the&amp;nbsp;Chief Operating Officer (COO)&amp;nbsp;will be responsible for developing a cohesive strategic operational vision and execution plan to drive superior performance, efficiency, and automation across the organization. This role is pivotal in ensuring AccuWeather&#39;s operational excellence, enhancing productivity, and driving overall organizational success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The COO will oversee, plan, organize, staff, and execute all operational activities across all business units. This includes process improvements, workflow automation, performance monitoring, team development, budget management, and risk management. The COO will play a crucial collaborative role working cross-functionally with members of the Executive Team and other departments such as IT, Finance, HR, and Marketing to ensure seamless integration of processes and strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This person will have the key responsibility for leveraging technology and innovative practices to enhance efficiency, streamline processes, and drive overall operational excellence. The ideal candidate will be a dynamic leader with strong business acumen, an entrepreneurial spirit, and a deep understanding of operational principles and practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KEY RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement long-term operational strategies that align with the company&#39;s goals and vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate and provide leadership with the executive management team on key planning issues and important business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities for process improvements and automation to enhance productivity and streamline operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate strong business acumen and an entrepreneurial spirit to drive operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain organizational knowledge of markets, products, customers, and competition required to achieve business unit goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workflow Automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the assessment and redesign of workflows to incorporate advanced automation technologies, including AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead initiatives to implement software and tools that automate repetitive tasks and improve operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with IT, finance, HR, marketing, and other departments to ensure seamless integration of automated processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with functional and departmental managers to understand all necessary aspects and needs of operational development, and to ensure they are fully informed of operational objectives, purposes, and achievements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of collaboration and continuous improvement across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage relationships with internal and external stakeholders, including suppliers, partners, and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Monitoring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish KPIs to measure the effectiveness of automated workflows and operational performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize data analytics to drive decision-making and optimize operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure quality control of all company output as it pertains to delivery of services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure activities meet and integrate with organizational requirements for quality management, health and safety, legal stipulations, environmental policies, and general duty of care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budget Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage the operational budget across all business units, ensuring resource allocation aligns with strategic and automation initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor financial performance and implement cost-saving measures where applicable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with direct reports to prepare business plans for each business unit, to include profit, revenue and sales goals, personnel budget, and investment in research, development, and marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and mentor a high-performing operations team, promoting a culture of innovation and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide training and support to staff on new technologies and automated processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspire and manage the team, fostering a collaborative and productive work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify potential risks associated with operations and automation and implement mitigation strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with industry standards and regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Crisis Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take charge in high-priority crises, providing decisive direction and communication across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business Administration, Operations Management, or a related field; MBA strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years of experience in leading operations management, with a focus on process improvement and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of successfully implementing automation technologies in a corporate environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with a data-driven mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent leadership and communication skills, with the ability to influence at all levels of the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in project management and change management methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of operations principles and practices, capable of turning strategies into actionable operational plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High emotional intelligence and confidence level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel as required, approximately 5–10%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Adopter and Implementer:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proactively seeks and integrates new technology advances, especially AI, to streamline operations and create or improve products from existing tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ability to quickly adapt to changing operational conditions and emerging trends in the industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Critical Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong problem-solving skills and the ability to think critically about operational challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-Centric Approach:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Deep understanding of customer needs and preferences to ensure operational processes deliver optimal customer satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Familiarity with operations management tools, ERP systems, and data analytics platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Follow Through:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ensures that operational plans and strategies are executed effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organization Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Highly organized with excellent time management skills, and a quick thinker with a keen eye for detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Works well with key individuals across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Works to continually improve and innovate operational processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT ACCUWEATHER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;AccuWeather, recognized and documented as the most accurate and most used source of weather forecasts and warnings in the world,&amp;nbsp;has saved over 12,000 lives, prevented injury to over 100,000 people, and saved companies tens of billions of dollars through better planning and decision-making.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Billions of people around the world rely on AccuWeather’s proven Superior Accuracy™ across our consumer digital platforms. AccuWeather.com is the #1 weather destination and one of the top 100 most-visited websites in the world, and our award-winning AccuWeather app delivers detailed real-time forecasts to millions of smartphones.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;AccuWeather forecasts also appear on digital signage, in 700 newspapers, are heard on over 400 radio stations, and viewed on 100 television stations. The AccuWeather Network and AccuWeather NOW® reach an audience of over 125 million on cable and streaming platforms including DirecTV, Charter Communications - Spectrum, Verizon, Philo, Frndly TV, Comcast’s Xfinity X1 and Xfinity Stream, Roku, Xumo, Rockbot, LG, and Amazon Freevee.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;AccuWeather For Business serves more than half of the Fortune 500 companies and thousands of other businesses and government agencies globally.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dr. Joel Myers, Founder and Executive Chairman, established AccuWeather in 1962 and is considered the “father of modern commercial meteorology.” Myers, a leading creative thinker and visionary, has been called “the most accurate man in weather” by The New York Times and has been recognized as one of the top entrepreneurs in American history by Entrepreneur’s Encyclopedia of Entrepreneurs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;COMMITMENT TO DIVERSITY &amp;amp; INCLUSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AccuWeather is proud to be an Equal Opportunity/Affirmative Action Employer. We are committed to equal employment opportunity to all applicants and existing employees and we evaluate qualified applicants without regard to race, creed, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy and gender identity/expression), sexual orientation, age, ancestry, physical or mental disability, marital status, political affiliation, religion, citizenship status, genetic information, veteran status, or any other basis protected under applicable federal, state, or local law.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;AccuWeather is committed to working with and providing reasonable accommodations to individuals with disabilities. If you need a reasonable accommodation because of a disability for any part of the employment process, please send an e-mail to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:human.resources@accuweather.com&quot;&gt;human.resources@accuweather.com&lt;/a&gt; and let us know the nature of your request and your contact information.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;POSITION SUMMARY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AccuWeather is seeking an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Contracts Manager&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;to join its Legal team. &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Contracts Manager is responsible for managing the development, review, negotiation, execution, and administration of AccuWeather&#39;s commercial contracts. Reporting to Counsel, this individual contributor serves as a key liaison between the Legal department, Sales, Operations, Finance, clients, vendors, and other business stakeholders to facilitate timely contract execution while identifying and managing contractual and business risk. The role independently manages a portfolio of agreements, supports contract process improvement, and leverages approved contract management and AI-enabled tools to improve drafting, review, administration, and workflow efficiency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is onsite 5 days per week in our State College, PA HQ office.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;KEY RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Manage the preparation, review, negotiation, execution, and administration of a broad range of commercial agreements, including customer, vendor, confidentiality, licensing, services, and other business agreements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Draft and revise contracts, amendments, addenda, statements of work, and related legal and commercial documents using approved templates and established contracting standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently review contract terms and identify legal, financial, operational, and commercial risks, escalating significant or non-standard matters to Counsel as appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate contractual provisions with customers, vendors, and other external parties within established parameters and in consultation with Counsel when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Sales, Operations, Finance, and other internal stakeholders to understand business objectives, resolve contractual issues, and facilitate timely contract execution.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Liaise with clients and outside counsel to ensure contract documentation is accurate, complete, and consistent with negotiated business terms and company requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Evaluate information and documentation entered into the contract management system for accuracy, completeness, consistency, and overall acceptability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Manage contract workflows, approvals, renewals, amendments, obligations, and other key contract lifecycle activities within company systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Utilize approved AI and contract management technologies to assist with contract drafting, review, analysis, and comparison of contractual provisions while ensuring appropriate human review and judgment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Identify opportunities to improve contract processes, templates, procedures, and workflows and assist with implementation and adoption of contract management system enhancements or changes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain standardized contract templates, clause libraries, procedures, and related resources in collaboration with Counsel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Monitor contract activity and provide reporting and analysis on contract status, turnaround times, renewals, obligations, and other relevant metrics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Provide guidance to business stakeholders regarding contracting processes, documentation requirements, and established contractual standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Maintain organized and accurate contract records while ensuring the confidentiality and security of sensitive business and legal information.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Perform other related duties as assigned.&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business Administration, Contract Management, Legal Studies, Finance, or a related field, or an equivalent combination of education and relevant professional experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;5-7+ years of progressively responsible experience in contract administration, contract management, commercial contracting, legal operations, or a related contracting role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience drafting, reviewing, and negotiating commercial contracts and related legal documents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience independently identifying contractual risks and working with legal counsel and business stakeholders to resolve contract issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience managing contracts through multiple stages of the contract lifecycle, including drafting, negotiation, approval, execution, amendment, renewal, and closeout.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Proficiency with contract management systems and common business applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills, including demonstrated contract drafting and editing capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong organizational, time-management, analytical, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
