&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in ERP administration, business systems management, business applications, or related IT/business systems roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience administering or supporting ERP platforms such as Microsoft Dynamics 365 Finance &amp;amp; Operations, NetSuite, or similar enterprise systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of business processes across Finance, Accounting, Operations, Procurement, Sales, HR, and Reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading ERP implementations, upgrades, integrations, or post-implementation optimization initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to translate business requirements into scalable system solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with system integrations, workflow automation, reporting tools, dashboards, permissions, roles, and data governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with a process improvement and problem-solving mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to work effectively with technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage competing priorities in a fast-paced, cross-functional environment.&lt;/li&gt;
