&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;- Bachelor&#39;s or Masters degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, Information Technology, or a related field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;- 5+ years of experience designing and developing backend software or distributed systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;- Advanced experience developing software using Scala or Java, with experience applying functional programming concepts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;- Expertise in developing and deploying applications in cloud environments such as Microsoft Azure, AWS, or Google Cloud.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;- Deep experience with relational database architecture, including schema design, SQL, and performance optimization at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;- Proven experience architecting solutions for structured and semi-structured data formats such as XML and JSON, RESTful APIs, and regular expressions, across multiple external data providers.&lt;/p&gt;
