&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;- Experience providing technical guidance to other software developers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;- Ability to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced development environment.&lt;/p&gt;
